      <activity id="95d8432b-2c58-51a8-aedb-7720f415e40d" activityNameId="73fdd4a6-24ec-51d9-a545-1821502b23d6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Cathode, copper, primary copper production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Cathode, copper, primary copper production
The multi-output-process "anode slime generation, primary copper production" delivers the co-products "anode slime, silver and tellurium containing, primary copper production" and "cathode, copper, primary copper production". The product "cathode, …" is an intermediary in the production of refined copper and is not to be used by the LCA practitioner.  The flow "anode slime, …" is a by-product of this process that receives part of the burdens allocated.;
UUID: f3cb3170-e687-3885-9f62-f2ca7a005bf8
The module includes the upstream production of primary copper represented by the pri-mary copper input and the resource depletion of silver and telluride found jointly with copper
Location: Data refers to global copper production and hence reflects a global average.
Technology: Electrorefining of copper anode.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f3cb3170-e687-3885-9f62-f2ca7a005bf8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
